  Keep the window, angular cuts, thickness, and bounded testing columns $b'' \, f''$ fixed. For each fixed main time $a$ and approximation index $l$, insert the auxiliary $s$-limit. Trace cyclicity pairs
  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(5.9)")
