  #emph[Recovering a near-identity unitary.] Taking traces gives $d' = 1$. A matrix equivalence over the factor $Q_0$ reduces $q$ to a single unit, and the row $V$ becomes an actual unitary $u$ with $u^(*) Theta \( Gamma \) u subset Q_0$ and $p_0 = u e_(Q_0) u^(*)$. Moreover
